###############################################################################
# Q12 -- Gaps and ambiguities (prose; not triples)
###############################################################################

# - The aspirin result is stated as a median force error (27.0 meV/A bootstrapped vs 94.0 meV/A standard) on the re-evaluated validation set; medians are not MAE/RMSE and are not encoded. Other errors are approximate ('~30 meV/A') or figure-only (Figs. 2-6).
# - Water self-diffusion coefficients and RDFs are property results.
# - Author affiliations are not encoded (ORCIDs are those deposited with the DOI metadata, source: datacite).
